body:
It looks like this was originally just copied pasted from toggle breakpoint with minimal changes before that got reworked. 
`tx->set_line_as_breakpoint` makes CodeEdit emit `breakpoint_toggled`, which is connected to `ScriptTextEditor::_breakpoint_toggled` which calls `EditorDebuggerNode::get_singleton()->set_breakpoint`. So I'm pretty sure that line isn't needed for ScriptTextEditor (otherwise how would DEBUG_TOGGLE_BREAKPOINT be working?).

Which means it could be simplified and it can be with the other breakpoint options.
```suggestion
