body:
I realized my fix did not fully work as it broke when opening closed shaders from the file list (it wouldn't switch to the newly created editor). So I also changed the `ScriptEditor` `edit` function to always `_go_to_tab` which is how it was in the old `ShaderEditorPlugin`

### Old
```c++
if (p_grab_focus) {
_go_to_tab(tab_container->get_tab_count() - 1);
_add_recent_script(p_resource->get_path());
}
```
###  New
```c++
grab_focus_block = !p_grab_focus;
_go_to_tab(tab_container->get_tab_count() - 1);
grab_focus_block = false;
_add_recent_script(p_resource->get_path());
```

